capability property/encodes-everything  whether an encoding has bytes for every character
  heroes  unicode/encodings.can_encode_everything
  go      -
  rust    Encoding::can_encode_everything
  python  -
  java    Charset.contains
  dotnet  -
  note    true for UTF-8, UTF-16BE and UTF-16LE, false for gb18030 (U+E5E5), as encoding_rs answers; encoding_rs answers true for `replacement`, whose encoder is UTF-8's there, where `encode` here refuses it

capability property/browser-flags  whether a browser or a mail reader shows or saves an encoding
  heroes  refused: every encoding here is one a browser reads, by the standard's own rule that a browser supports these and no other
